Before adding permutation lowering, the expanded independent native oracle
records 49,152 actual x86 CPU/RAM observations and 16,688 fault frames.
--observe does not invoke the compiler. The unchanged compiler then refuses:

vector 360 red: compiler=-102 decode=0 argument=93000b0907 operand-bits=128/128 register-bits=128/128

